# PyDev interpreter and AST caches a test run writes into this module, at its root as well as
# beside the fixtures. They record absolute paths from the machine that ran them. The rules below
# apply from this directory down, so they cover the module root, which `resources/.gitignore`
# does not reach and which is where a wildcard add picks these up. All three are listed even
# though `resources` already ignores two of them for its own tree: naming only the ones that have
# been committed so far leaves the next one to be caught the same way, by someone reading a diff.
*.pydevinfo
v1_astmanager/
v2_indexcache/
